<title>HUNGARY: Hungary cen bank cuts four repo rates by 0.5 pts.</title>
<headline>Hungary cen bank cuts four repo rates by 0.5 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank National Bank of Hungary (NBH) cut two repo and two reverse repo rates by 0.5 percentage points each on Monday, the NBH said.</p>
<p>The overnight and one-week repo rates were reduced to 27 percent, the one-month reverse repo went down to 21.50 and the one-week reverse repo was cut to 21.00 percent.  </p>
<p>The overnight reverse repo remained unchanged at 17.50 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>The NBH last changed repo rates on January 24.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 40 40</p>
